# Public browser configuration template.
#
# The legacy relay in server/ remains loopback-only and intentionally has no
# public Vite environment variable. Do not point this value at that relay.
#
# Set this only to the authoritative Worker origin after its allowed-origin
# policy includes the exact browser origin serving the client. HTTPS is required
# outside local development. Leave it empty to keep the online entry disabled.
VITE_KYX_AUTHORITY_ORIGIN=
